{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1474167-riptide","id":1474167,"title":"Riptide","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-02-07T23:40:14-08:00","id":1474167,"title":"Riptide","content":"Hello friends.<br /> <br /> I played a great werewolf game with a friend, so much fun that I decided to turn it into a story.<br /> <br /> This story takes place in Del Norte County, CA, and retells the tale of a troubled adolescent growing up in Crescent City, CA. Cursed with many typical frailties of male teenagehood - insecurity, aggression, growing awareness of the opposite sex - Ari's difficulties are exacerbated by a terrible grudge carried against a classmate, abandonment by his father, and of course the growing pains of transforming into a savage, man-eating predator.<br /> <br /> Credit is obviously directed toward the game's authors, but this story is mostly a gift to <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/606-aynie\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar606_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"606\" data-vbnamecard=\"606\">Aynie</a>, who was the ST for the original game. She designed the setting, the majority of the NPCs and kept the Hunt coming on strong while giving us time to play Teen Wolf.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://archiveofourown.org/works/33658300/chapters/83644837\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://archiveofourown.org/images/ao3_logos/logo_42.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://archiveofourown.org/works/33658300/chapters/83644837\" target=\"_blank\"> Show Chapter | Archive of Our O